# Rego: Open Policy Agent policy language reference (OPA 0.6x); requirements/languages/rego.md
name     rego

keyword  package import default not with as some every in if contains else
builtin  true false null input data count sum max min sort concat contains startswith endswith
builtin  sprintf lower upper split trim to_number is_string is_number object array set

line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes
string   ` `  : multiline
escape        : u4
operators  +-*/%&|!<>=:.
calls
